@crew v-orme-ronan
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello there. Ronan. Plants. Your garden's lovely. I have notes.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. The tomatoes and I have been talking. They're doing well.
?

== chat
- Plants grown in space lean towards voices. So I talk to them. Science.   #funny
- Cruz has done wonders here. I've told them so. Twice.

== near
? deck:3
- That big tree. Somebody's been climbing it. I won't say who.   #funny
? habit:bar-regular
- One drink after the garden. The soil's still under my nails.
?

== bye
- {bye}. Say hello to the tomatoes if you pass.

== smalltalk
- Lovely loam, this.
- Morning, tomatoes.   #funny
